# Cross-origin isolation. TFHE's threaded WASM needs SharedArrayBuffer, which browsers gate behind
# these two headers. Without them the relayer SDK silently falls back to single-threaded and every
# encryption gets slower — it degrades quietly rather than failing, so it must be verified, not
# assumed. Kept in step with the headers() block in next.config.mjs, which a static export drops.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
